  "overview": "They're Mean, Moist and Loaded for Action!\n\nWorms is an ultra-fast-paced game of team strategy for up to 16 players. It's a little bit \"Lemmings\" and a lotta bit \"Terminator\"... only more pink and squishy. With bazookas, homing missiles and cluster bombs blasting the screen in an unrelenting fury, only the moist can survive!"
